From: SteamOS ARM maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: add EVO ICNA3512 modes and bounded linear brightness

Brightness and lifecycle: Armada 1e2802a, 0028 + 0060 panel patches.
Additional ICNA3512 modes and command sequences: Teguh Sobirin / Aaron Kling,
https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260514-icna35xx-v3-2-c304f04c32c4@gmail.com
Keep 120 Hz preferred and the existing 60/120 timings. Scope additional
modes to ayaneo,pocketevo-panel. No VRR or panel-link 10-bit claim.
Gamma 2.2 is a model inherited from other ICNA3512 modules, not an EVO
measurement. Clamp all DBV writes to 3413 including DT curve overrides.
Restore DSI mode flags on brightness transfer failures.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c
