+/*
+ * Both DDICs drive their panels at luminance ~ (DBV/4096)^2.2, measured
+ * on the AYN Odin 3 and Odin 2 Portal modules. Userspace brightness
+ * models assume a scale linear in luminance, so the sysfs value is
+ * linear light, mapped to DBV through these levels.
+ * Ends at 3413, the vendor DBV ceiling, which the DDIC does not enforce.
+ */
